# ROVEXO Owner Preview Policy v3.0 (CANONICAL FREEZE · P0 · OWNER APPROVED)

## Absolute rule

**If the Owner cannot test it on their phone, it does not exist for approval.**  
**If the Owner cannot open it, it is not ready.**  
**If the Owner cannot approve it, Freeze is forbidden.**

## Official Owner URL (sole)

**https://www.rovexo.co.uk**

One project · one official URL · one permanent domain · all modules under the same origin  
(`/balance` · `/wallet` · `/checkout` · `/orders` · `/account` · `/settings` · `/sell` · `/inbox` · `/saved` · `/search` · …).

SSOT: `lib/preview/owner-preview-ssot.ts`

## Deprecated (never cite as official)

`https://preview.rovexo.co.uk` — DNS failure · replaced under Policy v3.0.

## Forbidden for Owner approval

localhost / `:3000` / `:3010` · temporary links · multiple preview URLs · daily/module-specific links · screenshots-only · video-only · desktop-only · inaccessible URLs

## Cursor must

1. Keep one permanent Owner URL  
2. Verify DNS · HTTPS · mobile · responsive · navigation  
3. Send **only** `https://www.rovexo.co.uk/<path>`  
4. Wait for Owner approval  

## Cursor must never

Redesign because localhost fails · request screenshot-only approval · create multiple preview links · replace official URL without Owner approval

## Freeze gate

No Freeze · Commit · Push · Deploy · Production Certification until:  
Official URL exists · DNS · HTTPS · Mobile · iPhone · Android · Responsive · Navigation · Owner access · Owner visual approval — **all PASS**.

URL may change only on: DNS failure · permanent infra migration · catastrophic failure · Owner approval.
